  "fixture": "illustrator-first-period",
  "describes": "In Other Worlds UG, December 2026 and January 2027. Four card sales in euros, three carrying the illustrator's art (see `payees_note`), one to the Netherlands at 21 %. The last is paid at 23:30 UTC on 31 Dec, which is 1 Jan in Berlin. The December statement is paid on 8 Jan; on 12 Jan a poster from the Dutch order comes back and is refunded. Page size 2, so the first pull pages.",
